        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "106 Sperrin Road, Drimnagh, Dublin 12\r\n\r\nDavid Ross Estate Agents, your local property experts, take great pride presenting new to the market no.106 Sperrin Road. This fine 2 bedroom extended property comes to the market awaiting its lucky new owners to turn the key.\r\n\r\nLocated in the heart of Drimnagh, number 106 is surrounded by a host of local amenities with many shops, coffee shops, parks and sports facilities right on your doorstep. This property is also within very close proximity to areas such as Rialto and Crumlin.\r\n\r\nWalking through the front door you are met with a warm entrance hallway with a cosy front reception room just off this. Moving through the property you have a second, slightly more spacious reception room. Towards the rear you have an extended kitchen. This downstairs area has a lot of potential to be made into a fantastic entertaining space with plenty of light and flow.\r\n\r\nTo the rear you have a spacious and private back garden. With its west facing aspect you're bound to catch a nice bit of evening sunlight during those long summer days.\r\n\r\nUpstairs briefly comprises two double bedrooms, one to the rear and a main bedroom to the front aspect. A fully tiled family bathroom completes the first floor.\r\n\r\nSperrin Road benefits from fantastic public transport links with many bus routes running throughout the area. The red Luas line is also not too far away as well as the M50 motorway only being a short drive away which opens up access to the Greater Dublin Area and surrounding counties.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is recommended to see everything that this property has to offer.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Extended\r\n- Off street parking\r\n- Prime location\r\n- Public transport links"
      },
